      "detailed_description": "Imagine your greatest idea. The one which could make you happy, successful, famous, maybe even rich. Keep this image of your idea in mind. How would it be, to take a journey to fulfill it?<br>Viaerium is a short, serene story about You, embarking on a path through radiant vistas to make your Idea come true - To reach the enigmatic Council. <br><br><i>Those who are lost must seek Wisdom. Those who seek Wisdom must seek the Council. </i><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Vision: </strong> Wander through the thought-provoking odyssey to look at your life goals through a different perspective.<br></li><li><strong>Tranquility: </strong> With outstanding songs by Philipp Weigl and Kai Engel to accompany you through the radiant landscapes of Viaerium.<br></li><li><strong>3D Platforming</strong>: Calm journey unfolds with a relaxing third-person movement. <br></li><li><strong>Simplicity</strong>: Simple controls fit for everyone.<br></li><li><strong>No Violence</strong>: Take it at your own pace and rules.</li></ul>",
